# Text files stay with LF line endings on every computer, so a build from a checkout (or the ZIP GitHub
# makes) gives the same bytes everywhere: the same DLL and the same pack as the published ones.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Kept exactly as they are, byte for byte: the game's layout files use CRLF, and the test fixtures are
# what the tests expect (one mod list has Windows line endings on purpose).
*.twui.xml -text
tests/fixtures/** -text
*.pack binary
*.png binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
